---
title: "FIG. 57-03: Scope Resolution Protocol"
patent: EGS-57
---
flowchart TB
    A[Node Reference: parent.child.node] --> B{Parse Scope Path}
    B --> C[Resolve Parent]
    C --> D{Parent Exists?}
    D -->|Yes| E[Enter Child Scope]
    D -->|No| F[Error: Invalid Path]
    E --> G{Child Exists?}
    G -->|Yes| H[Resolve Node]
    G -->|No| I[Error: Node Not Found]
    H --> J[Return Scoped Node ID]
    
    J --> K[ScopedNodeId]
    K --> L[scope: parent.child]
    K --> M[node_id: node]
